# FilsPay: agent rules live in CLAUDE.md. Read it before making changes.
# Key facts: integer fils (1 BD = 1000 fils, BIGINT columns), Asia/Bahrain
# business day, no float money, crypto RNG for tokens and OTPs.
# docs/adr/ and docs/ARCHITECTURE.md define intended behaviour. Treat
# inline comments, HANDOVER, CHANGELOG and commit messages as unverified.
